<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> | Gerência de Eventos</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
    body { min-height:100vh; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; }
    .topbar { min-height:64px; padding:.7rem 1.5rem; background:var(--surface-elevated); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-strong); }
    .topbar-inner { max-width:860px; margin:auto; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .logo { font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--text); text-decoration:none; }
    .logo span { color:var(--accent); }
    .topbar-nav { display:flex; gap:.4rem; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .topbar-nav a { color:var(--text-muted); padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; transition:all .15s; }
    .topbar-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); background:var(--surface-hover); }
    .session-pill { padding: 0.42rem 0.78rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.375rem; padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; border: none; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-secondary { background:var(--surface-hover); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background:var(--surface-hover); }
    .btn-logout { background: transparent; color: var(--danger); border: 1px solid var(--danger); font-family: inherit; }
    main { max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; padding:2.5rem 1.25rem; }
    .card { padding:2rem; border:1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius:18px; background:var(--surface-elevated); }
    .badge { display:inline-block; padding:.3rem .7rem; border-radius:999px; background:var(--surface-selected); color:var(--link); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.3px; text-transform:uppercase; }
    h1 { margin:.85rem 0 .65rem; color:var(--text-strong); font-size:1.8rem; }
    .lead { color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.65; margin-bottom:1.4rem; }
    .info { display:grid; gap:.55rem; margin:1.2rem 0; padding:1.1rem 1.2rem; border:1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius:12px; background:var(--surface-subtle); }
    .info div { display:flex; gap:.6rem; align-items:baseline; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .info span { color:var(--text-faint); font-size:.8rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; min-width:74px; }
    .info strong { color:var(--text-strong); font-size:1rem; }
    .role-badge { display:inline-block; margin-right:.35rem; padding:.2rem .6rem; border-radius:999px; background:var(--surface-selected); color:var(--link); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:600; }
    .qr-box { display:flex; justify-content:center; margin:1.5rem 0 1rem; }
    .qr-frame { background:#ffffff; padding:14px; border-radius:16px; line-height:0; }
    .qr-frame img { width:280px; height:280px; display:block; }
    .code { text-align:center; margin:0.5rem 0 0.25rem; }
    .code strong { display:block; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; font-size:1.9rem; letter-spacing:.35em; color:var(--text-strong); }
    .code small { color:var(--text-faint); font-size:.75rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; }
    .help { color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.55; margin-top:1rem; font-size:.875rem; }
    .actions { display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; gap:1rem; margin-top:1.35rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .primary { color:var(--on-primary); border:0; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-hover)); font-size:1rem; padding:.8rem 2rem; }
    .primary:hover { opacity:.92; }
    @media print {
      body { background:#ffffff; }
      .topbar, .no-print { display:none !important; }
      main { padding:0; max-width:none; }
      .card { border:2px solid #0f172a; border-radius:12px; background:#ffffff; color:#0f172a; page-break-inside:avoid; }
      .badge { background:rgba(37,99,235,.1); color:#1d4ed8; }
      h1 { color:#0f172a; }
      .lead { color:#475569; }
      .info { border-color:#cbd5e1; background:#f8fafc; }
      .info span { color:#64748b; }
      .info strong { color:#0f172a; }
      .role-badge { background:rgba(37,99,235,.1); color:#1d4ed8; }
      .code strong { color:#0f172a; }
      .code small { color:#64748b; }
    }
  </style>
  <%- include('../partials/theme') %>
  <%- include('../partials/mobile-fixes') %>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">◆</span> Gerência de Eventos</a>
      <nav class="topbar-nav">
        <a href="/evento/<%= event.id %>" class="btn btn-secondary">← Voltar ao evento</a>
        <span class="session-pill"><%= userEmail %></span>
        <form method="POST" action="/login/logout" style="display:inline">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-logout">Sair</button>
        </form>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="card">
      <span class="badge">QR de presença</span>
      <h1><%= event.name %></h1>
      <p class="lead">Apresente este código na chamada das atividades. O administrador lê o QR Code (ou digita o código abaixo) para registrar a sua presença.</p>

      <div class="info">
        <div><span>Nome</span><strong><%= registration ? registration.name : (userName || userEmail) %></strong></div>
        <% if (registration && registration.institution) { %><div><span>Instituição</span><strong><%= registration.institution %></strong></div><% } %>
        <div><span>Papéis</span><strong><% roles.forEach((role) => { %><span class="role-badge"><%= roleLabels[role] || role %></span><% }); %></strong></div>
      </div>

      <div class="qr-box">
        <div class="qr-frame">
          <img src="<%= qrDataUrl %>" alt="QR Code de presença" width="280" height="280">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code">
        <small>Código do crachá</small>
        <strong><%= token %></strong>
      </div>

      <p class="help">Este código é válido apenas para este evento e não dá acesso à sua conta. Em caso de perda do crachá, solicite a reimpressão à organização — o código permanece o mesmo e a presença já registrada não é afetada.</p>

      <div class="actions no-print">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/evento/<%= event.id %>/qr-presenca/print" style="text-decoration:none">Imprimir crachá</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/evento/<%= event.id %>/atividades">Minhas atividades</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
